# Glarb, Calamity's Augur: "You may look at the top card of your library any time. You may play lands and cast spells with mana
# value 4 or greater from the top of your library." The Juggernaut (mana value 4, exactly the limit) on top of Bot1's library is
# cast from there with a Black Lotus and a Mox Ruby; Bot2, whose top card is also a Juggernaut, may look at nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Glarb, Calamity's Augur
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Island
Juggernaut
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Juggernaut
Island x12

